ARCHITECTURE OVERVIEW
=============================================

STACK:
  Runtime: Node.js 18+
  Framework: Express.js 4.x
  Database: PostgreSQL (Neon)

  Deployment: Render (single web service)
  Structure: Monolithic (server.js + public/ + migrations/)

HOW TO DEPLOY INDEPENDENTLY:
  1. Clone the repo
  2. Set environment variables (see list below)
  3. npm install
  4. npm run build  (installs deps + runs migrations + generates assets)
  5. npm start      (starts Express on PORT)

ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES:
  DATABASE_URL          — PostgreSQL connection string (REQUIRED)

  PORT                  — Server port (default: 3000)
  NODE_ENV              — "production" or "development"
  OPENAI_API_KEY        — OpenAI-compatible key for AI vision features

  OPENAI_BASE_URL       — OpenAI-compatible proxy URL
  POLSIA_API_KEY        — Polsia platform API key
  POLSIA_ANALYTICS_SLUG — Analytics injection slug
  CD_COOKIE_SECRET      — Credit-directory auth cookie secret
  ORIGIN_COOKIE_SECRET  — Origin page auth cookie secret
  FR_COOKIE_SECRET      — Future-research auth cookie secret
  ADMIN_API_KEY         — Admin API endpoints auth key
  HOLOGRAPHIC_API_KEY   — Holographic scanner endpoints key


ROUTE → FILE MAPPING:
